'''DNA Plantation''' (DNA果樹園, ''DNA Kajuen'', '''DNA Orchard''') is the 35th sub-chapter of [[Uncanny Legends]], and the 84th sub-chapter overall. It was added in [[Version 10.5 Update|Version 10.5]], and is available up to {{4c}} difficulty. This sub-chapter has a heavy focus on enemy spam.

==Difficulty==
Not overly challenging outside of [[Banana Genomes]], which has many, many [[Youcan]]s supported by an [[Angelic Sleipnir]], and [[Cloned Farmers]], an all-[[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] stage similar to [[Caliban's Keeper]], but with added [[Mr. Mer]]s.
{{LegendDiff|130|170|100}}

==New Features==
As of [[Version 11.5 Update|Version 11.5]], the [[:Category:Behemoth Enemies|Behemoth]] type is introduced here. Like [[:Category:Colossus Enemies|Colossus]], Behemoth is a unique typing that is not considered a trait, but always overlaps with a standard enemy type. [[:Category:Behemoth Slayer Cats|Behemoth Slayers]] deal 2.5x against them, take only 0.6x damage from them and have a set chance to dodge their attacks.

This sub-chapter introduces one new enemy:
*[[Ragin' Gory]]: A stronger [[Gory Dark]] that has more health, attack power and range, [[Immune to Freeze|immunity to freeze]] and the Behemoth attribute.

