==Trivia==
*This is one of the four Uncanny Legends sub-chapters to have no [[:Category:Relic Enemies|Relic Enemies]], the others being [[Diver's City]], [[Spacetime Distortion]], and [[Dead Heat Land]].
*DNA Plantation and [[Forgotten Graves]] are the only sub-chapters with multiple stages to use the same [[Backgrounds|background]] for every stage.

